<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" /><meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0d0f" />
<title>AI Lab · <%= p.name %></title><meta name="description" content="AI、Agent、RAG 与模型工程实验项目。" />
<%- include('partials/seo', { seo }) %>
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/site.css" /><script src="/js/site.js"></script>
</head><body>
<header class="detail-header"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">HX</span><span class="brand-copy"><strong><%= p.name %></strong><small>AI LAB</small></span></a><div class="detail-actions"><a class="button button--ghost" href="/">← 回到主页</a><button class="icon-button" id="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-label="切换明暗主题"><svg class="theme-icon theme-icon--moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.8Z"/></svg><svg class="theme-icon theme-icon--sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.93 4.93l1.42 1.42M17.66 17.66l1.41 1.41M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.93 19.07l1.42-1.42M17.66 6.34l1.41-1.41"/></svg></button></div></header>
<main class="notes-shell"><header class="notes-hero ai-list-hero"><div class="card-no">AI LAB / EXPERIMENTS</div><h1>从实验出发，<br><em>把模型接进真实工程。</em></h1><p>记录 AI 应用、Agent、RAG、MCP 和评测实践。</p></header><section class="ai-list"><% projects.forEach((project,index)=>{ %><a class="ai-list-card" href="/ai/<%= project.slug %>"><div class="ai-card-top"><span>EXPERIMENT_0<%= index+1 %></span><b><%= project.status %></b></div><div class="ai-node"><i></i><i></i><strong>AI</strong></div><h2><%= project.title %></h2><p><%= project.summary %></p><div class="project-tags"><% if(project.models){ %><span><%= project.models %></span><% } %><% for(const item of project.stack){ %><span><%= item %></span><% } %></div></a><% }) %></section></main>
<footer class="footer"><div><span>© <%= year %> <%= p.footerText %></span><span><%= views %> 次独立访问</span></div><a href="/">BACK HOME ↑</a></footer></body></html>
